      "boundElements": [],
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "A white-labeled, no-code platform where OpenLoop's clients configure and publish\nHIPAA-compliant patient intake funnels without engineering \u2014 built on pre-built clinical\nprotocol templates that enforce medical requirements while allowing brand customization.\n\nIt is NOT an EHR \u00b7 NOT a scheduling tool \u00b7 NOT a CRM \u00b7 NOT a generic form builder.",
      "originalText": "A white-labeled, no-code platform where OpenLoop's clients configure and publish\nHIPAA-compliant patient intake funnels without engineering \u2014 built on pre-built clinical\nprotocol templates that enforce medical requirements while allowing brand customization.\n\nIt is NOT an EHR \u00b7 NOT a scheduling tool \u00b7 NOT a CRM \u00b7 NOT a generic form builder.",
